    "title": "Sunshine Power",
    "description": "Welcome to Sunshine Power, the ultimate casual idle game! Harness the unlimited potential of solar energy as you embark on an exciting journey of power generation. Connect solar panels to the main power grid using massive cables, converting the energy into batteries or charging electric vehicles. Explore and expand your solar empire, providing power to various facilities in a vibrant amusement park. With simple gameplay mechanics and addictive progression, become a master of green energy and watch your park thrive under the radiant glow of the sun. Get ready to embrace the power of the sun!",
